WEBVTT

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.950
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.280
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.120
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.820
With you guys

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.490
If we join forces

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.460
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.800
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:02.970
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:09.110
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:11.180
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.120
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.260
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.430
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.430
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.130
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:33.170
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:36.040
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:40.040
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.250
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:53.290
Someone once said...

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:58.100
There is lily of the valley that tastes 
like delicious ramen when it blooms...

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:02.430
Ramen of the Valley!

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:08.010
There is corn on the cob that, instead 
of kernels, has aromatic karinto,

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:12.110
which tastes like brown sugar and 
sesame with a habit-forming texture...

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.710
Karinto on the Cob!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.320
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:26.160
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:35.070
At the end of their desperate battle, 
the Four Kings are driven into a corner.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.640
In other words,

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.740
the more damage you do,

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.010
the tastier the Four-Beasts becomes.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:54.820
Energy that craves you

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.790
versus your appetite. Which 
will come out on top?

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:02.030
Shall we have a showdown?

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.500
The winner will indisputably be

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.530
...the predator!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.740
Secret Technique: Meal Fit for a King!

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:12.130
The wild nature that lurks inside 
of us is clad in a tuxedo.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.930
We're gentlemen, yet are devoted to our meal.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:20.170
That's the behavior of apex predators.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.780
Perfect...

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:31.480
...predator kings!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.890
Meal Fit for a King!

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:16.930
I give thanks to all the 
ingredients of this world!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.460
Let's eat.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:31.540
Meal Fit for a King...

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.770
It's the energy of appetite itself.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.240
It's energy that eats the enemy

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:41.210
and grows bigger with that savoriness.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:07.610
The attack won't end until the 
ingredient is completely devoured.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.920
Have you realized it, Four-Beasts?

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:28.590
This ain't a battle. It's a meal.

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.760
The moment this technique was completed,

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.430
the fight was over.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.740
This was an eat or be eaten 
showdown, with no hard feelings.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.740
We're the predators!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.550
Be at ease, Four-Beasts.

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:57.160
Your life definitely won't go to waste.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:10.170
All of your blood and meat

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:13.000
will be devoured by the human race!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.640
We won't leave behind even 
one bit of flesh or bones.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.900
The green clouds are clearing up!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.200
So we give thanks

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:46.970
to your life too.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:55.750
Thank you for the meal.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:26.380
The Four Kings won...

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.120
They did it, Komatsu-kun.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:53.030
I'm surprised you caught up with me.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:01.070
Tracking people is my specialty.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:03.040
Especially suspicious people...

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.620
Criminals always return to 
the scene of their crime.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.090
Are you the one who's behind this?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.360
What are you after?

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:24.460
You would do better not to...

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.130
...pry.

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:51.290
The appetite is filled up with 
the Four-Beasts' savoriness!

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.790
It's blowing up like a balloon!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:55.990
Meal Fit for a King...

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:58.300
Energy that consumes everything...

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:01.000
We sure pulled off an incredible technique.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:04.140
Baloney!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.540
The technique's really just appetite.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:10.980
And all this means is we 
got appetite in spades.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:12.110
Maybe my techniques,

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.350
like Knife and Fork,

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.380
are really energy from my Gourmet Cells,

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:20.320
projected via appetite.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:27.530
Like they're introductory forms of the 
secret technique, Meal Fit for a King.

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.230
In any case,

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:40.070
we definitely got stronger from this battle.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:47.410
Terry!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.150
Kiss!

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.250
Queen!

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.050
Thank you.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:59.990
Without you guys, we never would've 
been able to beat the Four-Beasts.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:05.130
You chumps better train your 
partners a little more.

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:14.840
Like this horse I'm borrowin'.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:19.580
Toriko-san! Coco-san! Sunny-san! Zebra-san!

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:23.250
We brought the poison 
antidote, Medicinal Mochi!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.220
Everyone!

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.820
Komatsu! Rin!

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:30.920
Thank you for the food.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:37.330
Delicious! This is Medicinal Mochi?!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.030
I wanna eat more!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.430
Toriko! I'm so happy you're alive!

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:45.270
And you've got nothing to say 
to me, your big brother?!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.340
You're a lifesaver, Komatsu-kun.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.570
True. Though we beat the Four-Beasts,

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:53.240
we were on the verge of 
dying from that Green Rain.

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:57.620
I'm so happy you're all alive!

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.220
It's thanks to you, Komatsu.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:04.520
I'm grateful to you for letting 
us focus solely on fighting.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:08.160
And you saved hundreds of millions of lives.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:12.330
Although it seems hundreds of 
thousands of lives were lost.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.100
Not exactly.

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:15.970
Look!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:19.170
Right next to the stuffed 
Meal Fit for a King!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.670
What is that?! Leftovers?

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:26.080
Our appetites only devoured 
the Four-Beasts itself.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.380
What was left behind...

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.780
You mean...

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.790
I can see a lot of electromagnetic waves!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.060
Yeah, I can hear 'em.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.640
The people swallowed up by the Four-Beasts

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.010
are coming out!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.880
They were still alive inside 
the Four-Beasts' body!

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:04.050
Amazing!

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:04.780
Sunny!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.250
On it!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.620
Hair Net!

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:24.300
Yeah! Yeah!

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.400
They're alive!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.040
Look!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.440
The Four-Beasts' meat is coming down too!

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.130
It looks delicious!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:04.110
Alright! Let's eat this meat

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.440
with the rest of the human race!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.680
Yeah!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.990
Let's go! This'll be a 
heaping helping of a story!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:22.360
Okay, now it's our turn.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:25.030
Time to cook the Four-Beasts!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.630
Yeah!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.770
Alright!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.680
There's plenty of fat too!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.240
It's soft and moist!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.780
This is the highest grade of meat!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.180
Hey! You're supposed to wait!

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.950
Delicious!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:52.020
Dammit, Zebra! Sitting 
there, eating nonchalantly!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:17:00.060
The Four Kings captured a top-rank 
ingredient worthy of their name!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.970
Thanks for comin', Tom!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.130
Tom-san!

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:06.670
I'll deliver a ton of the meat 
while it's at its freshest!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.370
Yeah! I'm countin' on it!

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:51.720
I'll pour Sesame Chestnut and Seven 
Flavor Herb tempura dipping sauce on it

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.220
and you've got Setsuno's fresh, 
vivacious meat and rice bowl.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.620
Of course the rice is Blissful Rice.

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.860
I'm done too!

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:04.000
Nakaume Culinary School's cafeteria special.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.960
Minced hamburger steak set meal!

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:11.840
I'd like to fill kids up with this.

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:20.650
Alright. The curry is complete too.

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:25.950
I'll quickly broil the meat together 
with fat and rich, savory gravy

00:18:28.090 --> 00:18:30.420
then mix it with the flavor of curry

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.730
that's been mellowing for 25 years.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:38.360
The more it stews, the more savoriness 
comes out in this Dhamala Sky original.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:41.170
Topped-off curry special!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:44.640
I'd like to put this flavor 
on my limited time menu.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:09.330
Humanity has survived the crisis

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.230
and now gets to eat this heaping 
helping of fantastic food together?!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.770
That's what I call an unexpected scoop!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:17.040
But not really.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.510
After all, it's huge news that 
everyone knows about already!

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:25.910
I cooked the Four-Beasts' 
steak meat teriyaki-style

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:29.850
and then made a sandwich with that, melted 
Mineral Cheese, bacon, and lettuce.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:36.690
I give thanks for all of 
this world's bounty...

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:41.560
Let's eat!

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:43.930
Let's eat!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.310
It's delicious, Komatsu-kun.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:58.810
Thank you!

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.610
Let's get some over here too, Komatsu!

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.410
Sure... but...

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:05.050
I just gave you a hamburger 
like a minute ago, didn't I?

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:08.120
Yeah, you did. I need to 
eat about 200 more of 'em.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.820
You eat like a bird.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:10.790
Shut up!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.690
With all this juicy gravy, it's delicious!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.930
Kid!

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.600
Make as much as you can 
of this and bring it over!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.230
Um...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:25.040
I-It's going to take some time...

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:29.240
...but keep on eating!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.780
What are you after?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.890
You would do better not to...

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.520
...pry.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.190
It'll get you killed.

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:50.660
Right here...

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:51.860
...and now.

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:08.510
I have been alone

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:15.920
Ever since that day

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:23.560
All I got was a definite history

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:30.270
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:33.640
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.110
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:41.180
A dream is still a dream

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:44.480
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:48.920
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.620
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:52.790 --> 00:22:00.430
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:06.000
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:10.540
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:17.960
Hiding Level 18

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:13.510
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 18!

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:15.410
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:17.480
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:22.650
Well, it looks like today's scene is an 
athletic festival on a clear autumn day.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:25.420
Where could Yun be?

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:31.360
Yun is... right here!

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:38.700
How was it?

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:43.240
Kids, be careful you don't get 
lost in a crowd like this.

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:45.480
I've got a heaping helping of 
curiosity about the results

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:48.010
of the bread-eating contest 
between Toriko and friends,

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:50.010
but please check out this segment!

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:53.850
It's a scoop big enough to choke on!

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:56.000
Chef Komatsu takes the stage he's always dreamed of!

00:22:56.400 --> 00:22:58.770
But then Reviver Teppei appears...

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.030
The Upcoming Festival! Dangerous Wriggling Critters!

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:04.250
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
